# Butler Routes - Silverpine Forest recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE is
# physically in Silverpine Forest (zone key 1421), verified against the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever item, vendor and drop tables).
# 17 recipes are vendor-sold (all vendors Horde faction) and one Alchemy
# recipe drops exclusively in-zone; every other dropped recipe is a
# generic multi-zone world drop (see docs/silverpine-companions-inventory.md),
# and quest records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# The three rare-signature world drops (Gorefang, Vicejaw, Krethis) ride
# the rares companion, not this one. No Blacksmithing plan, Engineering
# schematic, First Aid manual or Fishing book has a Silverpine source in
# the data - stated, not padded. Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
guide butler-routes-completionist/silverpine-recipes
title Silverpine Forest - Recipes & Patterns
levels 10-20
zone Silverpine Forest
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords silverpine forest, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Tailoring - Andrew Hilbert (Sepulcher)

  zone map 1421

  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 3556 -- Andrew Hilbert (43.22,40.66)
  buy 5771 "Pattern: Red Linen Bag"
  buy 6272 "Pattern: Blue Linen Robe"
  note Andrew Hilbert (Horde) sells both patterns at the Sepulcher; nothing else in the data sells them. Stock class unconfirmed.

